OL,3,GNEWSA'I've had someone drag me across
OL,4,Athe shop counter'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We've had instances of us being pushed
OL,7,Finto fixtures and I've had someone drag
OL,8,Fme across the counter when I have
OL,9,Frefused to serve them."
OL,11,FAndrew Bond runs the Premier Store in
OL,12,FTorquay, Devon, and is one of several
OL,13,Fshopkeepers in the South West who have
OL,14,Fsaid shoplifting has been a daily
OL,15,Fproblem in recent years.
OL,17,FDevon and Cornwall Police said violence
OL,18,Fagainst shopworkers was increasing, but
OL,19,Fnew reporting platforms have
OL,20,Fcontributed to a significant rise in
OL,21,Fshoplifters being brought to justice.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
