OL,3,GNEWSA'I've had someone drag me across
OL,4,Athe shop counter'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Office figures show only 16% of
OL,7,Freported shoplifting crimes resulted in
OL,8,Fa charge or summons in Devon and
OL,9,FCornwall in 2022-2023, but Sgt Chris
OL,10,FChaloner said that rate had risen to
OL,11,F31% since June 2026.
